     "A Horse cart",
     "B Steam and Motor Water Wagons",
     "(Returns to be sent to the Company by the Council monthly).",
     "(3) For use by Steam Rollers. (Returns to be sent to the Company by the Council monthly).",
     "(4) For washing carts (to be in proportion to number of carts) at 25 galls per cart per week",
